      "speaker": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "Frequently. That's how I've gathered all this wisdom.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=49e08464a35e45478029e76b12710107.wav",
      "duration": 3.252834467120181
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-038",
      "run_id": 36,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "He showed her how to stand with her feet steady and how to move away from someone trying to grab her. He made her practise until she stopped trying to win and started paying attention.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=4fdd843aa1414a6d9fb6137bfe4be838.wav",
      "duration": 9.152426303854876
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-039",
      "run_id": 37,
      "speaker": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "Good.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=427169fe744a4ef2b159232454e464bf.wav",
      "duration": 0.942358276643991
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-040",
      "run_id": 38,
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "voice_id": "8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "source_text": "Can I punch you now?",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613/id=d33a8d93c6774c19add49546cea6ffab.wav",
      "duration": 1.447732426303855
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-041",
      "run_id": 39,
      "speaker": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "Absolutely not.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=91f7318ea470459e9cc9313d6b090495.wav",
      "duration": 1.3305442176870748
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-042",
      "run_id": 40,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "She punched his arm anyway. He looked gravely offended. That evening they ate toast for dinner because the cupboards were nearly empty. Cassian put the better-looking pieces on her plate and insisted he preferred the burnt ones. Years later, she would remember that lie more clearly than almost anything he ever taught her. On her tenth birthday he came home with a supermarket cake in a cardboard box and a candle shaped like the number seven.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=3aa9fa99cfd945c5a8d7ad7c3460e080.wav",
      "duration": 23.43108843537415
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-043",
      "run_id": 41,
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "voice_id": "8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "source_text": "That's not my age.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613/id=1aa0ed8c8c1b4d7bb700ad41384a0871.wav",
      "duration": 1.5889342403628117
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-044",
      "run_id": 42,
      "speaker": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "That's because you're a very advanced seven-year-old.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=4b70b4cd0c2a446497ce9102d0a45d8a.wav",
      "duration": 3.092426303854875
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-045",
      "run_id": 43,
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "voice_id": "8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "source_text": "I'm ten.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613/id=810d497b260948548b7fcbbf230e6cdf.wav",
